Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.19,0:00:50.23,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Diante do desespero absoluto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.53,0:00:54.23,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Que quase consumiu os nossos corações
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.73,0:01:00.78,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Você ainda encontrou a coragem para sorrir
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.03,0:01:05.58,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Como se aceitasse tudo aquilo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.38,0:01:08.84,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Eu perdi a minha voz
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:11.46,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}E as palavras que queria dizer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:16.71,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Mas a cada vez que caía de joelhos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.06,0:01:21.01,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Eu me levantava e continuava a caminhar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:26.68,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Estávamos buscando o futuro branco ideal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.89,0:01:31.91,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}A nossa única esperança
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:34.40,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Agora posso ter ficado sem nada
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.57,0:01:39.82,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\blur7.5}A não ser estas emoções ardentes que
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.88,0:01:42.92,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,380)\blur7.5}Não têm para onde ir
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.17,0:01:48.17,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Ainda assim, buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.55,0:01:51.58,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Com mais de uma resposta certa
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.82,0:01:55.41,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\blur7.5}Não vou parar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.71,0:01:57.44,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,380)\blur7.5}Até encontrar
